{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short niche speed-running game with an advanced movement mechanics and hand made maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To celebrate my 25th birthday and to recover from burnout I made this game. In each level a part of a message I wrote is read aloud by me.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most levels contain more than one path to reach the objective (of blowing out a candle on a birthday cake for me :D).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Speed contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Multiple hand made levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A speed rating system and personal bests for every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* An advanced movement system that includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprinting </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall-running </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double jumping </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sliding / crouching</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grappling (as in with a grappling hook)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launchers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleportation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transforming into a flying spirit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all the movement tech that can be achieved by combining those..</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330060?t=1765896849","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330060/fa4e5672423b114ab7df30dba757a2a724e5306a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765896849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330060/c17e3e3d3375c7b9c4cb3d2d1f446925